    clarissa "我……我还是去你办公室找你吧，先生……！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3641
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3642
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_73999bc7:

    # mcT "She's been stolen..."
    mcT "她被抢走了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3644
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5383beb6:

    # mcT "My girlfriend has been stolen."
    mcT "我女朋友被抢走了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3646
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_822bda6a:

    # mcT "My assistant has been stolen."
    mcT "我的助理被抢走了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3648
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3c143f73:

    # mcT "What did I do wrong this time!?"
    mcT "这次我又做错什么了！？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3650
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0742e591:

    # mcT "Did she hear us last night?"
    mcT "她昨晚听到我们了吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3652
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_086d984b:

    # mcT "Did she hear us speaking last night and got the wrong idea?"
    mcT "她昨晚听到我们说话，是不是误会了什么？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3653
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_798c9844:

    # mcT "It's the most logical scenario..."
    mcT "这是最合乎逻辑的情况了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3654
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b6dffe18:

    # mcT "Maaan... And today was starting off so well too..."
    mcT "唉……今天明明开头还挺顺利的啊……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3664
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_564d28fe:

    # mcT "Now I'm going to have to make amends for two people today..."
    mcT "现在我得向两个人赔罪了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3666
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c8b9d130:

    # mcT "I'll have to find her around campus and see what this is all about..."
    mcT "我得在校园里找找她，弄清楚这到底是怎么回事……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3667
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_bd3129dc:

    # mcT "And I guess apologise for something?"
    mcT "而且我猜还得为某件事道个歉？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3669
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_26a41dc9:

    # mcT "In the meantime, I should really get ready and go to [mich]'s. I'm cutting it very close to being late."
    mcT "不过眼下，我得赶紧收拾好去[mich]那了。再不走就要迟到了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3670
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e69973d8:

    # mcT "I swear to god if that stuck up bitch is sat on my chair again and lectures me..."
    mcT "我发誓，要是那个高傲的女人又坐上我的椅子教训我……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3674
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b7d3f046:

    # mc "There she is. My pride and joy!"
    mc "她在那呢。我的骄傲和宝贝！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3680
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_4aae1406:

    # mc "We all can dream..."
    mc "谁都难免会做梦……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3683
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d4f56eea:

    # mc "It's been a long time since I've driven you, baby."
    mc "好久没开你了，宝贝。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3684
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5095d95e:

    # mc "I've not neglected you, there just hasn't been much use for you with [school_name] being so close."
    mc "我可没冷落你。只是[school_name]离得这么近，没用得着开你。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3689
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fde5ffbc:

    # mc "Still purrs like the day I bought you, huh?"
    mc "还是跟我买你那天一样，一发动就呼噜呼噜的，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3690
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_977e7654:

    # "In reality, the engine wheezes like a chain smoker, but you grin like it's a symphony all the same."
    "实际上，引擎咳得像个老烟枪，你却还咧嘴笑着，仿佛那是什么仙乐。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3692
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_96589d2c:

    # "Respect what you have, but dream for more."
    "珍惜你所拥有的，但永远心怀更大的梦想。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3712
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c38b17d4:

    # mc "Damn... Do all of [soph]'s friends live in houses like these??"
    mc "天啊……[soph]的所有朋友都住在这种房子里吗？？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3713
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_64bfc97f:

    # mc "It's huge!"
    mc "好大啊！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3714
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c81ba82d:

    # mc "Too big for one person, though..."
    mc "不过一个人住的话，也太大了点……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3715
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2374f1c7:

    # mc "I remember she said her daughter's off at college in a different city. Husband bailed. Now it's just her..."
    mc "我记得她说过，她女儿在另一个城市上学院，丈夫也跑了，现在就剩她一个人了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3716
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_358393f3:

    # mc "Heh. Never thought I'd be delivering errands to a born-again nun."
    mc "呵，没想到我居然在给一个「重生」的修女跑腿。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3718
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_62b3610c:

    # mc "She should be home at least. Her car is still here."
    mc "她应该在家，至少她的车还停在这。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3721
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_68dfc3b3:

    # "After ringing the doorbell, you wait patiently for a good little while."
    "按了门铃后，你耐心地等了好一会儿。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3722
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ace9913e:

    # "Eventually you hear the patter of feet tapping on the wooden floor hurriedly." id D8_Skip_Scene_ace9913e
    "终于，你听见急促的脚步声在木地板上哒哒作响，越来越近。" id D8_Skip_Scene_ace9913e

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3725
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_920c6825:

    # "The door cracks open just enough for a familiar head of hair to peek out."
    "门开了一条缝，一头熟悉的秀发探了出来。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3726
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_cad7ebdb:

    # mich "I keep telling you! I'm already part of the church, you don't need to conv-"
    mich "我都跟你说多少遍了！我已经加入教会了，你不用再——"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3728
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d7bcb9dc:

    # mich "Oh! [player_name]...?"
    mich "噢！[player_name]……？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3731
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_36c4d9cb:

    # mich "How did you know-"
    mich "你怎么知道——"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3732
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_01415a12:

    # mich "Ah, [soph] must have told you!"
    mich "啊，一定是[soph]告诉你的！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3733
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c1e65b71:

    # mich "But, for what?"
    mich "可为什么呢？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3734
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_50db16cd:

    # mich "What brings you all the way out here this morning?"
    mich "今天早上你怎么特地跑这来了？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3736
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d83f88ec:

    # mc "Oh, I'm not here to preach. I'm here on behalf of the opposition."
    mc "哦，我不是来传教的。我是代表「对方」来的。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3737
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a71cec0e:

    # mc "Figured if anyone's worth poaching from the other team, it's you."
    mc "我想啊，如果对方阵营有谁值得挖过来，那非你莫属了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3739
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9e3469b3:

    # mich "On behalf of the opposition? That's crazy talk, [player_name]!" id D8_Skip_Scene_9e3469b3
    mich "对方代表？别开玩笑了，[player_name]！" id D8_Skip_Scene_9e3469b3

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3740
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f3bd5352:

    # mich "Here I am trying to be a good little saint, and you show up talking like a devil on my doorstep."
    mich "我正努力当个乖巧的小圣人呢，你倒好，直接像个魔鬼一样站在我家门口说这种话。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3742
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_85561b02:

    # mc "Guilty as charged. Hahaha."
    mc "罪名成立，哈哈哈哈。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3743
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d6485111:

    # mc "Morning, [mich]. I've been sent on a little errand to get something you got."
    mc "早上好，[mich]。我被派来跑个腿，拿点在你手里的东西。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3745
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_031f4714:

    # mich "Gets something I gots, huh? You'll have to be more specific."
    mich "我手里的东西，嗯？你得说得再具体点。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3747
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5c1037c2:

    # mc "[soph]'s necklace."
    mc "[soph]的项链。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3748
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3c6ba206:

    # mc "If I remember right, you were the one who yanked it off her neck during yoga."
    mc "如果我没记错的话，可是你自己在瑜伽课上一把从她脖子上扯下来的。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3750
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_78d06f14:

    # mich "Oh, that old thing! Now, why would she want it back all of a sudden?"
    mich "哦，那破玩意啊！她怎么突然又想要回去了？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3752
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_44c5a1f2:

    # mc "No idea. Maybe she misses the distraction."
    mc "谁知道呢。也许她怀念那种分心的感觉吧。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3754
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_7bb07786:

    # mich "Well, I put you behind her to get her mind off things. Didn't realize it'd get you so close."
    mich "我本来让你待在她后面，是想让她别胡思乱想。没想到竟让你们靠得这么近。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3756
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0798ab31:

    # mc "Worked for her. Maybe next time I should be a wall for you?"
    mc "对她倒是管用。下次要不要我干脆当你的墙得了？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3758
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f9327f5e:

    # mich "Careful what you offer, [player_name]. You might find out I'm even harder to keep focused."
    mich "你可想好了，[player_name]。说不定你会发现，我比她还难让你专心。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3760
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_19f0e16b:

    # mc "Guess that counts as training. Another notch toward my yoga license, right?"
    mc "那这算不算训练？离我的瑜伽教练证又近了一步，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3762
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_178dd8e4:

    # mich "Maybe... We'll have to see on the next session." id D8_Skip_Scene_178dd8e4
    mich "也许吧……看下一节课的表现吧。" id D8_Skip_Scene_178dd8e4

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3763
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_69cf7752:

    # mich "If there even is a next session... I'm not sure yoga's on the nun-approved list."
    mich "如果还有下节课的话……我不确定瑜伽是不是在修女的「许可清单」上。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3766
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0a6c009d:

    # mich "Buuuut, where are my manners!?"
    mich "哎呀呀，我这礼貌去哪儿了！？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3768
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_958301c2:

    # mich "Come inside and give me a hug!"
    mich "快进来，给我个拥抱！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3770
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3771
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_44cba45f:

    # mc "Can I? I mean... isn't that your nun habit?" id D8_Skip_Scene_44cba45f
    mc "我可以吗？我是说……那不是你的修女服吗？" id D8_Skip_Scene_44cba45f

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3773
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_52371911:

    # mich "{i}Oh heavens!{/i} What ever shall I do... Is the lord going to smite me down because I need a hug?"
    mich "{i}天哪！{/i}我可怎么办才好……难道主会因为我想要个拥抱就降下天罚吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3774
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_1c7a3a92:

    # mcT "..."
    mcT "……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3775
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3d6f436f:

    # mcT "Still as playful as ever..."
    mcT "还是跟以前一样爱开玩笑啊……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3777
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_25447217:

    # mich "I don't believe I stuttered..."
    mich "我不觉得自己说话结巴了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3779
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9572118f:

    # mich "Come{w} give{w} me{w} a{w} hug!"
    mich "快{w}来{w}给{w}我{w}一{w}个{w}拥{w}抱！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3781
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c83502fa:

    # mc "Alright, alright! I hear ya! One of the best hugs you'll ever have, coming in hot." id D8_Skip_Scene_c83502fa
    mc "好啦好啦！我听见了！你这辈子最棒的拥抱，来了！" id D8_Skip_Scene_c83502fa

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3784
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b7e2c87b:

    # mich "Did I tell you I missed this?"
    mich "我有没有告诉过你，我好想念这个？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3785
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2d38d2dc:

    # mich "It's not very often I get hugs anymore..."
    mich "现在已经很少有人抱我了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3786
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3c648e0e:

    # mich "It's been quiet since Dave left." id D8_Skip_Scene_3c648e0e
    mich "自从戴夫离开后，日子就一直很安静。" id D8_Skip_Scene_3c648e0e

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3788
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a73f6f7a:

    # mc "I can't believe he would do that to you. It wasn't even that long ago."
    mc "真不敢相信他竟会那样对你。那明明也没过去多久啊。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3790
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0cf9a23b:

    # mich "Yeah... didn't last, did it?"
    mich "是啊……没撑多久，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3791
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fd13bbec:

    # mich "He texted me out of the blue. New number. Said he found someone new, moved away."
    mich "他突然发来一条短信，换了新号码，说自己找到了新人，人也搬走了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3793
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_be743df6:

    # mc "Just like that?"
    mc "就这么……突然？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3795
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_90ec429c:

    # mich "Just like that. Left me, left Jessica."
    mich "就这么突然。丢下了我，也丢下了杰西卡。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3796
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3391352e:

    # mich "I'm not even angry that he left me. I'm angry for Jessica."
    mich "我甚至都不生他的气……我是替杰西卡生气。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3797
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_26f97cfd:

    # mich "A girl needs a father figure."
    mich "女孩需要一个父亲般的人。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3798
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_8ff715fe:

    # mich "Sometimes love goes cold, I get it."
    mich "有时候爱会变冷，这我明白。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3799
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_dbe5925e:

    # mich "But he had a family. Responsibilities. You don't just drop all that for some skan-"
    mich "但他有家庭，有责任。你不能就这样为了某个轻浮——"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3800
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d6a37401:

    # mich "For some other woman."
    mich "为了别的女人，就把这一切都抛弃了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3812
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b57cae1a:

    # mc "You don't need another man to make you worth something, [mich]."
    mc "你不需要靠另一个男人来证明自己的价值，[mich]。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3817
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2f1d8fc7:

    # mich "Careful, now. If you keep saying things like that, I might start thinking you're volunteering for the position."
    mich "小心点啊。你要是再这么说话，我可要以为你是在自告奋勇了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3820
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_130b6ed7:

    # mc "Maybe that's not the worst thing..."
    mc "也许……那也不是什么坏事……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3823
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_cf3acb83:

    # mich "Mhmm... The way you held me says plenty."
    mich "嗯哼……你刚才抱我的方式，已经说明了很多。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3825
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e0352a38:

    # mc "Can't argue with the truth, can I?"
    mc "事实摆在眼前，我还能反驳吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3827
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e6356311:

    # mich "Hehe! If that's the case, you better get used to helping out around here. Faith and chores... Two things you can't escape."
    mich "呵呵！要是真这样，那你最好习惯在这搭把手了。信仰和家务……这两样可逃不掉。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3829
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_1da74643:

    # mich "I've been slacking... It's getting a little dusty!"
    mich "我最近偷懒了……都积灰了！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3833
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b39c63cc:

    # "Your eyes land on a matte card tucked next to [mich]'s keys."
    "你的目光落在[mich]钥匙旁的一张磨砂卡片上。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3834
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b153faaa:

    # "It has a familiar symbol etched into the center of it."
    "卡片中央蚀刻着一个熟悉的符号。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3841
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_703e42e9:

    # mcT "Huh? Isn't that the same as [clarissa]'s?"
    mcT "咦？这不跟[clarissa]的一样吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3843
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0d41e0bd:

    # mcT "Why would [mich] have a card like that?"
    mcT "为什么[mich]会有那样的卡？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3845
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3eedbc1a:

    # mc "Hey, [mich], what's that card for?"
    mc "嘿，[mich]，那张卡是干什么用的？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3847
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d249efd8:

    # mich "Oh? That thing? I'm not sure. I was just given it the other day by Mother Superior and I was told to show it when I enter the church..."
    mich "哦？那个东西？我不太确定。前几天修女院院长刚给我的，还告诉我进教堂的时候要出示它……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3849
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_12f7ec0e:

    # mc "Why would you need an ace of diamonds card to enter the church?"
    mc "进教堂为什么需要一张方块A的卡？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3851
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5cdbf848:

    # mich "Beats me. But if it's what Mother Superior wants, it's what she's gonna get!"
    mich "我哪知道。但既然修女院院长要这样，那就照她说的办！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3853
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9030ef14:

    # mich "Is there something you know about it?"
    mich "你是不是知道些什么？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3855
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_795c9d78:

    # mc "Not really. Just someone else I know has one just like it."
    mc "其实也没什么。只是我认识的另一个人也有一张一模一样的。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:3857
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_472b4c67:

    # mich "Oh! What's their name? I'll introduce myself at the introduction!"
    mich "哦！那个人叫什么？我到介绍环节就过去认识一下！"

