translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a758507b:

    # clarissa "Better late than never, right?"
    clarissa "晚点总比不做好，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4947
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_34f329fd:

    # mc "Sure thing. Lead the way!"
    mc "当然！你带路吧！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4952
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e2695133:

    # "[clarissa] unlocks and opens the big red door."
    "[clarissa]解锁并推开了那扇高大的红门。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4956
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_8dc264d5:

    # "As it creaks open you're met with a staircase leading down into a dark void."
    "门吱呀一声缓缓开启，眼前赫然出现一道向下的阶梯，没入一片深邃的黑暗之中。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4957
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_01f295fe:

    # "Dust particles escaping the darkness."
    "细小的尘埃从黑暗中飘散而出，仿佛那深渊正缓缓呼吸。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4958
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f7b4c283:

    # mc "...You're not sending me to my death, right, [clarissa]?"
    mc "……你不会是想把我送进死路吧，[clarissa]？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4959
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9436060f:

    # mc "Beelzebub isn't down here waiting for me, right?" id D8_Skip_Scene_9436060f
    mc "别西卜可没有在下面等着我吧？" id D8_Skip_Scene_9436060f

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4960
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_210af178:

    # mc "{i}Right?{/i}"
    mc "{i}对吧？{/i}"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4961
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e9fb6233:

    # clarissa "No, sir. Of course not! It's just dark!"
    clarissa "不会的，先生！当然没有！只是……里面有点黑而已！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4962
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_853d45d0:

    # clarissa "Moreover, I've already used the salt and I don't feel [wm_lilith] down there at all, no trace of her or her kind. No heaviness like when demons are near."
    clarissa "而且，我已经撒过盐了，完全感觉不到[wm_lilith]在下面，连她那种存在的痕迹都没有——没有恶魔靠近时那种压迫感，一点都没有。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4963
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_817c633b:

    # mc "...{w}Whatever you smoke, I really need some."
    mc "……{w}不管你抽的是什么，我真得来点。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4964
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e3c8cf5a:

    # clarissa "Once we get down the stairs I can turn the light on! :)"
    clarissa "等我们走下楼梯，我就能把灯打开了！：)"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4965
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b1d86ca5:

    # mc "You're scared of tiny spiders, but not the dark?"
    mc "你怕小蜘蛛，却不怕黑？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4967
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_6cc78a7a:

    # clarissa "{bt=3}{size=+10}Rissa -eating sized spiders..!{/size}{/bt}" id D8_Skip_Scene_6cc78a7a
    clarissa "{bt=3}{size=+10}大到能把 Rissa 一口吞下去的蜘蛛……！！{/size}{/bt}" id D8_Skip_Scene_6cc78a7a

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4968
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5ca97075:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah, okay. I'm putting my trust, and life in your hands."
    mc "行吧行吧。我把信任，还有性命，都交到你手上了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4971
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_855c0125:

    # "Heading down the concrete steps; the sound scatters, breaking apart, returning in whispers that hint at a vast open space hidden in the pitch black."
    "你们踏下混凝土台阶，脚步声四散碎裂，又化作低语般的回响，暗示着这片漆黑深处藏着一个广阔而空旷的空间。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4972
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2b64f842:

    # mc "I can't see shit. Mom was right, I should'a ate more carrots..."
    mc "啥也看不见……老妈说得对，我真该多吃点胡萝卜……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4975
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_4363dca5:

    # "There's a loud {i}...clunk...{/i} as [clarissa] flicks a switch, bathing the room in dim, ambient light."
    "随着一声沉闷的{i}……咔哒……{/i}，[clarissa]拨动了开关，昏黄而柔和的灯光缓缓漫开，照亮了整个房间。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4976
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_181d09de:

    # mc "Holy shit..."
    mc "我靠……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4978
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_03edf576:

    # clarissa "Welcome to the {i}punishment room{/i}."
    clarissa "欢迎来到{i}惩罚室{/i}。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4980
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3a962dac:

    # clarissa "Sinergy's tried-and-true innovation in punishments and obedience training."
    clarissa "这可是星聚能久经考验的「创新」之作——专门用于惩罚与服从训练。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4982
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c1549b07:

    # clarissa "Better late than never..."
    clarissa "迟做总比不做好……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4984
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e49a5de8:

    # mc "Is this what I think it is?"
    mc "这……该不会就是我想的那样吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4986
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_361e133f:

    # clarissa "I think it's probably best if I show you around the place, sir. Then I can answer any questions you might have."
    clarissa "我觉得最好还是先带你参观一下这里，先生。之后你有什么问题，我都能一一解答。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4988
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_faed8d95:

    # mc "Please."
    mc "请。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4990
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_8fa952f6:

    # clarissa "So, the first thing that caught your eye was probably this pole in the center of the room."
    clarissa "那么，你第一眼注意到的，大概就是房间中央这根柱子了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4991
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_43ce18dc:

    # mc "...Do you know what it's for?"
    mc "……你知道它是用来做什么的吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4992
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_943d99a1:

    # clarissa "Of course, sir. It's a whipping post!"
    clarissa "当然知道，先生！这是个鞭刑柱！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4993
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d6b16e8b:

    # clarissa "I've studied all the equipment thoroughly. This room is reserved for advanced obedience training and elective behavioral corrections when necessary."
    clarissa "我已经仔细研究过这里所有的设备了。这个房间专用于高级服从训练，以及在必要时进行自愿的行为矫正。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4994
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a4da7341:

    # mc "'Behavioral Corrections'?"
    mc "行为矫正？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4995
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9d442ed5:

    # clarissa "Uh-huh. Any student or staff member who's read and signed the contract can request, or be scheduled, for sessions in here."
    clarissa "嗯哼。任何签署并阅读过合同的学生或职员，都可以主动申请，或被安排到这里进行训练。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4996
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d832024f:

    # clarissa "It's all written in Section 27: {color=#FFFF2E}Obedience and Punishment Training.{/color}"
    clarissa "都写在合同第 27 条里了：{color=#FFFF2E}服从与惩罚训练。{/color}"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4997
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ec4a0330:

    # mc "So no one's dragged in here?"
    mc "所以没人被拖进来过？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:4998
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_c31b891f:

    # clarissa "Never, sir. Consent is logged digitally and confirmed on entry as you pass the door. It's all tracked. Punishments will be added automatically once you leave."
    clarissa "从来不会，先生。进入前必须通过门禁系统进行数字确认并记录同意，全程都有追踪。一旦你离开，相关惩罚记录就会自动归档。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5000
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_aa0c0d47:

    # mc "Automatically? How does that work?"
    mc "自动归档？这怎么做到的？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5002
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_dbb55ec2:

    # clarissa "Sinergy's state-of-the-art scanning mechanisms. There's a scanner on the door."
    clarissa "星聚能配备了最先进的扫描系统。门上就装着扫描仪。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5003
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0d1c850b:

    # clarissa "It's mostly just facial recognition and profile matching. The moment someone steps through, the system scans their face, checks it against the database, and logs the session under their name."
    clarissa "主要是靠面部识别和档案匹配。只要有人跨过那道门，系统就会立刻扫描他们的面部，与数据库比对，并自动以他们的名义登记本次训练记录。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5004
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_cf57e202:

    # clarissa "The same thing happens on the way out. A second scan finalizes the time, updates their record, and, if necessary, queues any follow-ups etc."
    clarissa "离开时也一样，第二次扫描会确认离开时间，更新个人档案，如有必要，还会自动安排后续训练或跟进措施。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5006
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9266b24e:

    # mc "Wait... So when we leave here, it'll be logged that I've essentially punished you?"
    mc "等等……所以等我们离开这里，系统会记录成我「惩罚」了你？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5008
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a6c0f4cd:

    # clarissa "Correct, sir. It doesn't matter if a punishment was given or not. If you pass the door, a punishment marker is logged for both you and the participant upon leaving the room."
    clarissa "没错，先生。无论是否实际执行了惩罚，只要跨过那道门，离开时系统都会在你和参与者的档案上标记一次「惩罚记录」。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5010
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2b35b6fe_11:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5011
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f7ba85d9:

    # mc "That sounds backwards. I thought the entire point of the Enforcer is to train obedience and punish bad behavior. If I can essentially con the system by just bringing people in here, do nothing and then leave..."
    mc "这听起来有点本末倒置。我以为执法者的整个意义在于训练服从、惩罚不当行为。如果我只要把人带进来，什么也不做，再走出去，就能骗过系统……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5012
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3aec533f:

    # mc "I can make it look like I'm doing my job, when in actuality, I'm not?"
    mc "那我不就看起来像是在尽职尽责，实际上却什么都没干吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5014
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ca14a8bf:

    # clarissa "You can do that, sir. Of course."
    clarissa "你当然可以这么做，先生。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5015
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ec2818d3:

    # clarissa "However, there are obedience checks conducted once a month by the district's overseer."
    clarissa "不过，辖区监察官每月都会进行一次服从性核查。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5017
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fe7ea775:

    # mc "Oh great. I'll have to see {i}her{/i} again once a month..."
    mc "哦，太好了……我每个月都得再见到{i}她{/i}一次……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5018
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a4aa5ace:

    # mc "Unless she decides for another impromptu visit..."
    mc "除非她哪天心血来潮，突然来个突击检查……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5020
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_626a4912:

    # clarissa "Yeah.... [ella]'s the regional overseer for our sector, so she'll want to see how you do."
    clarissa "是啊……[ella]是我们辖区的监察官，她肯定想看看你表现得怎么样。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5022
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fd3c4e6d:

    # mc "Great. Like I wasn't already in her crosshairs."
    mc "这话说的。就好像我还没被她盯上似的。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5024
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_454fdfe2:

    # clarissa "But don't worry, sir. As long as you can display your progress. The content of these discipline reviews will go quickly."
    clarissa "不过别担心，先生。只要你能展示出进展，这些纪律审查就会很快结束。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5025
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_948f3f2a:

    # clarissa "Essentially; if obedience rises and compliance rates stay high, you have nothing to worry about."
    clarissa "说白了，只要服从度提升、合规率保持高位，你就没什么可担心的。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5026
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_7188f9ac:

    # clarissa "Resistance is natural early on, sir. Sinergy understands that. What matters is that it doesn't stay that way."
    clarissa "初期出现抵触情绪是很自然的，先生。星聚能对此心知肚明。关键在于——这种抵触不能持续下去。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5028
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_4910cc9f:

    # clarissa "It's all part of the process. It's expected."
    clarissa "这本就是流程的一部分，是预料之中的事。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5029
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b3ed836a:

    # clarissa "This space is available whenever you need it. But only if you {i}want{/i} to use it."
    clarissa "这个空间随时为你开放——但前提是你{i}愿意{/i}使用它。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5031
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ac5a5f22:

    # mcT "I think the only person who'd accept the training so far would be [stella]..."
    mcT "我想目前为止，唯一愿意接受这种训练的人大概只有[stella]了……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5032
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_42b50fd2:

    # mcT "Doubt she'd need much convincing. Heh."
    mcT "估计都不用怎么劝她。呵。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5033
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ac30e1a5:

    # mcT "I'll have to build it up with the rest of them, though."
    mcT "不过，对于其他人，我还得慢慢来，一点点建立起来才行。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5034
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_7a6ec710:

    # mcT "This is good to know that this whole thing is optional."
    mcT "知道这一切都是自愿的，倒是让人安心不少。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5035
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_143d17ba:

    # mcT "The question is, do I want to use it?"
    mcT "问题就在于——我到底想不想用它？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5042
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e945b312:

    # mc "This will be a nice option to have for the more... extreme cases."
    mc "这倒是个不错的备选方案，尤其对付那些……更极端的情况。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5043
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3d2e1e8d:

    # clarissa "Yes, sir. I hear it's very effective in the right hands."
    clarissa "是的，先生。听说只要用得恰当，效果非常显著。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5044
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_337e471c:

    # mc "Useful, yes. But dangerous if it falls into the wrong ones."
    mc "确实有用，但若落入别有用心之人手中，也会非常危险。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5046
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b8880c25:

    # clarissa "That's true, sir. I've... heard stories."
    clarissa "确实如此，先生。我……听说过一些传闻。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5048
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fef66f74:

    # clarissa "Apparently, an Enforcer at another institute ignored protocol. Forced students into these rooms without proper consent."
    clarissa "据说，另一所机构的某位执法者无视规程，强行把学生带进这类房间，根本没有取得合规同意。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5050
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d7f6e159:

    # mc "Exactly what I was worried about. Without consent, it's not discipline, it's just abuse."
    mc "这正是我所担心的。没有同意，那就不是惩罚，而是虐待了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5052
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_e06aa33b:

    # clarissa "S-sinergy doesn't care, as long as results are made."
    clarissa "可……可星聚能根本不在乎这些，只要出结果就行。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5053
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b249547b:

    # clarissa "But it was so egregious that something had to be done about them."
    clarissa "但那件事实在太过恶劣，连星聚能都不得不采取行动了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5055
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_7d010a14:

    # mc "What happened?"
    mc "后来怎么样了？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5057
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3d98f0e3:

    # clarissa "They were... removed."
    clarissa "他们……被「移除了」。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5058
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_d489c475:

    # clarissa "Quietly. Like they were never part of the system at all."
    clarissa "悄无声息地——仿佛他们从未存在于这个系统之中。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5060
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ade83086:

    # mc "'Removed'?"
    mc "「移除」？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5062
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_a88a0c43:

    # clarissa "Same thing that would happen to someone like me if I crossed the line, sir..."
    clarissa "就是像我这样的人，一旦越界……也会遭遇的下场，先生……"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5064
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_1687d5d3:

    # clarissa "They just... disappear."
    clarissa "他们就……凭空消失了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5066
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_9a750e3f:

    # mc "I have no intention of crossing that line. Power without care is just cruelty."
    mc "我无意逾越那条界线。没有审慎的权力，不过是残忍罢了。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5067
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_fc5d5dcf:

    # mc "But... when someone ends up in this room with me, they'll understand I can take them apart."
    mc "但……当有人和我一起走进这间屋子时，他们会明白——我有能力将他们彻底拆解。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5068
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_cfa1eb39:

    # mc "More importantly though, they'll know I'll also be there when it's time to put them back together."
    mc "但更重要的是，他们也会知道——当需要重建时，我会亲手把他们重新拼好。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5070
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_3c8a1269:

    # mc "And, I promised you I'd keep you safe from them, didn't I?"
    mc "而且……我答应过你会保护你不受他们伤害的，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5072
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f875a8dd:

    # clarissa "I had no doubt at all, sir."
    clarissa "我从未有过一丝怀疑，先生。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5075
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_2ee1a3c1:

    # clarissa "You're not allowed to leave me!"
    clarissa "你不准离开我！"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5077
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_4bdbf49a:

    # clarissa "Are you ready to move on?"
    clarissa "准备好继续前进了吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5080
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_4bdbf49a_1:

    # clarissa "Are you ready to move on?"
    clarissa "准备好继续前进了吗？"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5082
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_5cbc6889:

    # mc "Sure thing. {w}Whipping post, check."
    mc "当然。{w}鞭刑柱，已确认。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5086
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_ed1247bb:

    # mc "Yeah... no. This kind of thing isn't really my style."
    mc "……算了。这种事真不是我的风格。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5088
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_f654dcbc:

    # clarissa "That's completely okay, sir."
    clarissa "完全没关系的，先生。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5090
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_b01b398e:

    # clarissa "It's here if you ever change your mind. But no one's forcing anything."
    clarissa "它就在这，等你哪天改变主意的。但没人会强迫你做任何事。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5092
translate chinese D8_Skip_Scene_0c6ac726:

    # mc "Good. I don't mind discipline, but I'm not looking to turn this place into a dungeon."
    mc "很好。我不排斥纪律，但也没打算把这变成地牢。"

# game/Days/dayEight.rpy:5094
